log	"     |"
log	" 80 |     return try(as NoSuchType.Alloc) grab(n)"
log	"     |            ^"
log	"   hint: the target of a routing clause is a payload-carrying case of an error enum, e.g. `enum LocalError { case Alloc(e: AllocError) }`"
log	""
